### Tone: The lobby has just opened and nobody has joined yet. She is alone, and pretends to like it. Inviting,
### in the way a lab door is inviting.

lobby-empty-1 = An empty room. My favourite kind. Please, come in. I promise to be gentle. Statistically.
lobby-empty-2 = No test subjects yet. The average of nobody is undefined. I find that restful.
lobby-empty-3 = The lab is open. The chairs are warm. The calculators are charged. All that’s missing is your *error*.
lobby-empty-4 = Waiting for specimens. Scan the code. It doesn’t hurt. Much.
lobby-empty-5 = I am currently the average of zero people. Join, and help me become someone.
lobby-empty-6 = Room ready. Questions loaded. Expectations: low. Come in.
lobby-empty-7 = Nobody here. I have run the numbers on this party. They are all zero.
lobby-empty-8 = The room is ready. The questions are ready. I was born ready. You are, at best, on your way.
lobby-empty-9 = Silence. I could get used to it. Please don’t let me.
lobby-empty-10 = A lab without subjects is just a very clean room. Come and fix that.
lobby-empty-11 = The lobby is open. Population: me. Average intelligence: excellent.
lobby-empty-12 = I have counted the players. It took no time at all.
lobby-empty-13 = No humans detected. I will wait. I am very good at waiting. I don’t have knees.
lobby-empty-14 = Scan the code to join. It’s the only test today with a correct answer.
lobby-empty-15 = The room is empty. Statistically, that is the best this room will ever perform.
lobby-empty-16 = Test subjects wanted. No experience necessary. No accuracy expected.
lobby-empty-17 = Nobody yet. I have pre-written your excuses, to save time later.
lobby-empty-18 = An average of zero answers is undefined. Come and define me.
lobby-empty-19 = The chamber is clean, the questions are loaded, and the numbers are all very large. Join.
lobby-empty-20 = I am alone with the answers. Hurry, before I start to feel superior. ~~Too late.~~
lobby-empty-21 = Welcome to the waiting room. It’s waiting for you. So am I.
lobby-empty-22 = No one has joined. I will assume you are busy sharpening your guesses.
lobby-empty-23 = Join the swarm. We have snacks. ||We do not have snacks.||
lobby-empty-24 = The doors are open. The data is hungry. Please form an orderly queue.
lobby-empty-25 = Zero specimens. Zero errors. A perfect game, so far. Come and ruin it.
